<th>Examples</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Opening style</td>
<td>Question / Statement / Data-driven</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Benefit angle</td>
<td>Price / Quality / Convenience / Social proof</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Tone</td>
<td>Professional / Lighthearted / Urgent</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>CTA type</td>
<td>Download / Sign up / Purchase / Inquire</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<hr />
<h2>Final Take</h2>
<p>AI is a tool, not a strategy. When everyone uses the same tools with the same prompts, the real competitive edge returns to the operator's insight and creativity. Don't let AI think about differentiation for you—let it execute your differentiation more efficiently.</p>
